Suppose that Assumptions~\ref{ass:lipschitz_constant}, \ref{ass:workers_lipschitz_constant}, \ref{ass:convex} and \ref{ass:unbiased_compressors} hold. For Algorithm~\ref{alg:bi_diana}, the following inequality holds:
