  &\quad+ p\left(\frac{4 \omega L_{\max}}{n \bar{L}} + \theta_{t+1} - 1 \right) D_f(z^t, y^{t+1}) \\
  &\quad+ \frac{pL}{2} \ExpSub{t}{\norm{x^{t+1} - y^{t+1}}^2} - \frac{p \theta_{t+1}^2 \bar{L}}{2} \ExpSub{t}{\norm{u^{t+1} - u^t}^2}.
