  Using Assumption~\ref{ass:lipschitz_constant}, we have
\begin{align*}
  &f(x^{t+1}) - f(x^*) \leq f(y^{t+1}) - f(x^*) + \inp{\nabla f(y^{t+1})}{x^{t+1} - y^{t+1}} + \frac{L}{2} \norm{x^{t+1} - y^{t+1}}^2.
