Using the definition of $x^{t+1},$ we obtain
\begin{equation}
\begin{aligned}
  &f(x^{t+1}) - f(x^*)\leq (1 - \theta_{t+1}) \left(f(y^{t+1}) - f(x^*) + \inp{\nabla f(y^{t+1})}{z^t - y^{t+1}}\right) \\
