  &\quad+ \theta_{t+1} \ExpSub{t}{\inp{\nabla f(y^{t+1}) - g^{t+1}}{u^{t+1} - y^{t+1}}} \\
  &\quad+ \frac{L}{2} \ExpSub{t}{\norm{x^{t+1} - y^{t+1}}^2},
